      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. honestly i'm kinda paranoid because i read online that both of these can affect serotonin and if you mix them you might get serotonin syndrome or something? are you sure it's really safe to take it every 4 hours if i'm already on sertraline? i've been feeling a bit more restless than usual today too.",
